  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint Effort to Save The Environment Intervention</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The progam was designed and have been implemented with the objective of contributing to the sustainable restoration, management and increased incomes of communities adjacent to Kibaale, Itwaara and Matiri elephant corridors. Agroforesty practice, collaborative forest management with strengthening the alliance for forest conservation and supporting farmers cooperatves are the major interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
